# Chandra, Pyromaster's 0 exiles the top card of its controller's library and lets them play it this turn. Turn 1: the Mountain
# is exiled and played from exile as the turn's land. Turn 3: a Lightning Bolt is exiled and not
# cast; on turn 5, with a Mox Ruby and the Mountain able to pay for it, it can no longer be cast.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Mox Ruby
Chandra, Pyromaster
Island x4
Mountain
Island
Lightning Bolt
Island x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x31

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
