Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Chandra, Pyromaster.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Chandra, Pyromaster.Activate(Ability: 0)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Exile.Mountain.Play
? Bot1.Battlefield.Mountain.Tapped = false
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Chandra, Pyromaster.Activate(Ability: 0)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Exile = Lightning Bolt
[T5 Bot1.Main1]
! Bot1.Exile.Lightning Bolt.Cast(Bot2)

